ted_at":"2026-10-26T17:34:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T17:34:37Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/DocumentDrivenDX/umf/releases/download/untagged-5fabe26c49c0458d9868/umf_core-0.10.2.tar.gz"}],"tarball_url":null,"zipball_url":null,"body":"# UMF Core Python 0.10.2\n\nUMF Core Python 0.10.2 packages extension-defined kind support while the semantic Core version remains 0.10.0. Typed Migration SDK 0.5.7 is a separate release.\n\nThe qualified platform wheels are `cp311-abi3-manylinux_2_34_x86_64` and `cp311-abi3-macosx_11_0_arm64`. Each selected wheel passed its recorded 254-test installed-artifact suite with zero errors, failures, or skips. The source distribution was also rebuilt and tested on the recorded Linux and macOS cohorts; rebuilt wheels are qualification evidence and are not additional selected release wheels.\n\nThe evidence applies to the exact artifacts and environments listed in `qualification.json`. It does not establish broader platform compatibility, SQL migration behavior, or managed-host execution. `current-source-ci.json` records the qualified source and publisher-merge identities.\n"}